  npcName: Chef Sommai
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npcIntroDialogue:
  - "Hello! I\u2019ve seen your work, and the rooms you\u2019ve decorated so far
    look wonderful."
  - "I\u2019m planning to open a small restaurant of my own."
  - But before I start the restaurant, I want to prepare my home kitchen for cooking.
  - I need enough space for preparing food, cooking, and storing ingredients.
  - "Everything should be placed where it\u2019s easy to reach and use. I really
    don\u2019t like anything getting in the way while I\u2019m cooking."
  - "And don\u2019t forget the coffee maker! I need my coffee every morning!"
  - Please design a kitchen that is both beautiful and practical.
  npcCompletionDialogue:
  - "Wonderful! Everything is in the perfect place, and the kitchen looks beautiful
    and organized. Now I\u2019m ready to start cooking!"
